Good afternoon, Akhil,

I wanted to follow up regarding the Senior Financial Analyst role that you had applied to with our company.

I still show that you have not completed the initial skills assessment that had been sent out to you earlier this week. We are looking to move forward with interviews ASAP, so if you could please complete this at your earliest convenience that would be great.

If we do not hear back from you, we will assume that you are no longer interested in the role and will remove your application from consideration. Please feel free to reach out if you have any additional questions/concerns and I will be happy to address them in a timely manner.

Best regards,


