<html>
	<head>
		<meta content="text/html; charset=utf-8" http-equiv="Content-Type" />
		<style type="text/css">BODY{font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.5em }p{margin-top: 1.5em}ul{margin-top:0}a{color:black}</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<p>Hi Akhil,</p>

		<p>We’re excited about your application for the Principal Financial Analyst role. So, what’s next?</p>

		<p>We’re inviting you to our <b><u>Virtual Job Tryout</u></b>. Think of it as a two-way learning experience. We’ll learn about your background, strengths and approach to work. You’ll get insight into how we work at Capital One. Win-win! </p>

		<p>Wondering what the tryout covers? You’ll run through a series of mock tasks and questions related to the role. Here’s a quick overview of what you may experience (keep in mind, you won’t necessarily encounter all of these): </p>

		<ul>
			<li><b>Manage relationships</b>: Make decisions and respond to everyday work scenarios </li>
			<li><b>Work a business case</b>: Review and integrate information from multiple sources about a fictitious business and offer solutions to help it succeed</li>
			<li><b>Manage your projects</b>: Review and integrate information about a fictitious project and offer recommendations to keep the project on track</li>
			<li><b>Troubleshoot problems</b>: Review a set of inputs to troubleshoot and manage system performance</li>
			<li><b>Tell us your story</b>: Share how your background and experience has shaped you for this opportunity</li>
			<li><b>Describe your approach</b>: Tell us about your preferred style and approach to work</li>
			<li><b>Manage your team</b>: Leverage information about your team to optimize projects and drive performance</li>
			<li><b>Run your business</b>: Integrate information from multiple sources to drive area performance and help your leadership team succeed</li>
		</ul>

		<p>Learn more about the Virtual Job Tryout <a href="https://www.mycareeratcapitalone.com/careers/MHprofessional/">here</a>.</p>

		<p><b>You have <u>14 days</u> to complete the Virtual Job Tryout</b>. It’s not timed, but we recommend allowing at least 30 minutes to complete it.</p>

		<table width="100%">
			<tr valign="top">
				<td><img src="https://www.mycareeratcapitalone.com/ho3/abw/images/capitalone/email/mountain.png" width="75" height="75"/>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
				<td width="100%">
					<b>Ready? <a href="https://www.mycareeratcapitalone.com/wb/z/?i=C4785426&j=FA007">Click here to get started</a></b>.
					<br>
					You can use a computer, tablet or smartphone using the latest browser version. You’ll need speakers or headphones.
				</td>
			</tr>
		</table>


		<p>
			<b>Note:</b> If the link above does not work, please copy and paste the following URL into a new browser window: 
			<br>
			<br>
			<a href="https://www.mycareeratcapitalone.com/wb/z/?i=C4785426&j=FA007">https://www.mycareeratcapitalone.com/wb/z/?i=C4785426&j=FA007</a>
		</p>
		
		<p>To maintain the integrity of the assessment process, please complete the assessments independently, without the assistance from third parties and/or external sources (e.g. artificial intelligence or third party applications), and keep the assessment content confidential. All content in this link, including any instructional material, is proprietary and strictly confidential. Failure to maintain the confidentiality of the assessment process and materials will disqualify you from further consideration and other consequences, up to and including termination of employment.</p>

		<p><b>This link is personalized for your use only and should not be accessed by or redistributed to anyone else.</b></p>

		<b>Curious about what comes next?</b>
		<ul style="margin-top:0">
			<li>After you finish your Virtual Job Tryout, we’ll review it with the rest of your application</li>
			<li>If you’re selected to move forward, you’ll be invited to a series of interviews with Capital One associates. This is a great time to dive into the role, and share your skills and experience</li>
			<li>Before your interviews, we’ll make sure you have time to prep. We’ll be here to answer all your questions (We know you’ll probably have some!)</li>
		</ul>
		
		<p>Have questions we didn’t answer? Click <a href="https://www.capitalonecareers.com/faq/">here for FAQs</a> about all things application process at Capital One. Or get in touch with us at <a href="mailto:Careers@CapitalOne.com">Careers@CapitalOne.com</a>.</p>

		<p>Remember, we’re here to help with anything you need along the way!</p>
		<p>Thank you for taking this journey with us,<br>Capital One Recruiting</p>

		<table width="100%">
			<tr valign="top">
				<td><img src="https://www.mycareeratcapitalone.com/ho3/abw/images/capitalone/email/help.png" width="75" height="75"/>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</td>
				<td width="100%">
