<tr><td align='left' style='padding:4px 0'>
<h1 class="darkmode-t-strong h1-md" style="color:#2d2d2d;font-family:'Indeed Sans', 'Noto Sans', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:bold;line-height:35px;margin:0;padding:0;direction:ltr;">Don’t get skipped over – read&nbsp;this!</h1>
