<tr><td align='left' style='padding:4px 0;'>
<p style="color:#595959;font-family:'Indeed Sans', 'Noto Sans', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;line-height:24px;margin:0;padding:0;direction:ltr;" class="darkmode-t-base">Recruiters search for candidates using a combination of <strong>{“skills” +“current salary” + “experience”+ “location”+ }</strong> to find&nbsp;candidates.</p>
