<body>
                        <table role="presentation"  width="87%" border="0" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" >

                            <!-- COPY START -->
                            <tr>
                                <td style="padding-top: 24px; text-align: left; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.3em; color: #191919; font-family: Helvetica Neue, Arial, sans-serif;">
                                    This email was intended for Irfan Ali (Experienced ServiceNow Developer  ITSM Solutions Architect  Workflow Automation Specialist  Open to New Opportunities)
                                    <br /><a href="https://e.linkedin.com/pub/cc?_ri_=X0Gzc2X%3DAQjkPkSUTQG2tHhBzezdEECM0IzgbTqHSw0KeKlCBrm4T2UweeOGOj01DE6HFkvAco9W1XWsANvJfpFWBOkWVXtpKX%3DTTSYTSYY&_ei_=EZ8ytgxEdJsiu_q7dOiXv4GB1IcCcCGheK4V8TfaTFgc2dtn_OhU7gnakl6A7ERmTt3r62yHsCZU9E3_tr8KLboJPStMTzymCNltvKEEnuQ4xpB5Yt1tFFwVbqeM9Pc.&_di_=qjb3lutarhh7r493btqbd00s1kgmo72p3epqts58c3dc9mi4d3dg"><span style="color: #0A66C2; text-decoration: underline;">Learn why we included&nbsp;this.</span></a>
